        "Description": "The ICA have learnt of an upstart assassination organisation known as NOON. This organisation has made a reputation for itself by hacking ICA servers and stealing the data on our contacts, then completing it before we can for a higher fee by blackmailing the clients.\r\rLuckily, their own security is flawed. Our hackers have obtained data on the team assigned to kill Dino Bosco, and the board has cleared their immediate termination.\r\r47, we cannot afford to lose any more contracts. Take them out.",
